ts":[{"id":"entry-create-share","kind":"entry","statement":"CreateMemoShare obtains the current user, rejects an unauthenticated caller, resolves the memo, and performs the authorization checks before the share-creation call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":23,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"identity-active-admin","kind":"binding","statement":"The shared memo-management predicate requires an active user and accepts either matching authorship or the administrator role; IsInstanceAdmin also requires active status.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":55,"endLine":85}]},{"id":"resource-active-nonspace","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler requires the selected memo to have Normal row status and rejects the SPACE audience before creation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":41,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"authorization-author-or-admin","kind":"control","statement":"access.CanManageMemo(user, memo) is the decisive handler authorization control for the memo, and its predicate allows an active instance administrator even when the actor ID differs from memo.CreatorID.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":61,"endLine":85},{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":48,"endLine":52}]},{"id":"protected-create-share-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the checks, the handler creates a write policy for the caller, marks it CreatingShare, and passes it with the memo ID and actor ID to Store.CreateMemoShare.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":66,"endLine":77}]},{"id":"store-policy-gate","kind":"control","statement":"The store CreateMemoShare wrapper validates the supplied memo-write policy before forwarding the request to the driver; the supplied policy contains the actor identity and CreatingShare intent.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-94b067169ac3605d","startLine":37,"endLine":49},{"sourceId":"src-9bc01fffab4188fc","startLine":126,"endLine":138}]}],"d